stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Restart: ledger/proof lost
    Restart --> Queued: owner original
    Queued --> Held: observe None / running Unknown
    Held --> Held: probe Unknown / Keep, same original
    Held --> Wake: scoped source + current completed reply
    Wake --> Reserved: Idle driver recheck + reserve
    Wake --> Held: changed source or revoked proof, same deadline
    Reserved --> Delivered: current + first-key gate / one original
    Held --> Refused: fixed original deadline / owner pre-key CAS
    Refused --> Explained: one reason notice / no body replay
    Held --> Refused: existing cancel or lifecycle disposition
    Delivered --> [*]
    Explained --> [*]
